---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Note on the original 2013 Bukkit plugin
---------------------------------------------------------------------------

The MIT grant above covers this entire repository.

Until the 3.0.0 release the tree under `src/me/sablednah/` held the original
2013 Bukkit/Spigot plugin, kept only as a reference while the port was
written. It was removed at release, as always intended, and it remains in the
git history. It shared no code with the mod above.

It was NOT covered by the MIT grant and is not now: it was originally
distributed under Creative Commons BY-NC-ND, and parts of it derive from
other people's work (the 2013 README credits DarkLust's DaySpawner and
BlockBreaker code, and some utility classes appear to have come from other
plugins), so those parts remain under whatever terms their authors granted.
Anyone recovering that directory from the history should treat it on those
terms rather than these.
